<programme start="20261013140000 +0000" stop="20261013170000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">North Carolina at Pittsburgh</sub-title><desc lang="en">No. 25 Pittsburgh (5-0) hosts North Carolina (2-2). North Carolina fell 37-26 to No. 3 Notre Dame and looks to Billy Edwards Jr. who leads with six TDs. Pittsburgh beat Virginia Tech 35-33 and looks to Holden Geriner who has two TDs this season.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261013170000 +0000" stop="20261013200000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Miami at Clemson</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Clemson Tigers host the No. 4 Miami Hurricanes at Memorial Stadium in South Carolina. The Tigers beat the Golden Bears, 24-10, paced by quarterback Tait Reynolds, while the Hurricanes beat the Chippewas, 52-3, paced by quarterback Darian Mensah.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
