<programme start="20261014171600 +0000" stop="20261014181100 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">NOS4A2</title><sub-title lang="es">El camino nocturno</sub-title><desc lang="es">Vic McQueen toma un atajo para llegar a Haverhill. Lou y Wayne enfrentan una terrible amenaza. Charlie Manx le pide un favor a un viejo amigo. Millie Manx enfrenta el pasado.</desc><credits><director>Craig Macneill</director><actor>Zachary Quinto</actor><actor>Ashleigh Cummings</actor><actor>Ólafur Ólafsson</actor><actor>Jahkara Smith</actor><actor>Ebon Moss-Bachrach</actor><actor>Virginia Kull</actor><actor>Jonathan Langdon</actor><actor>Ashley Romans</actor><actor>Mattea Conforti</actor><actor>Jason David</actor><actor>Celeste Arias</actor><actor>Paul Schneider</actor><actor>Tom Savini</actor><actor>Reg Rogers</actor></credits><date>20200705</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.2.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E03</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/903dc7e72a2c04ce9db34bfe0fd174944493d066.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261014181100 +0000" stop="20261014190500 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">NOS4A2</title><sub-title lang="es">La casa del lago</sub-title><desc lang="es">Con Charlie Manx a la caza, Vic y su familia se esconden con Maggie. Wayne sufre misteriosas pesadillas mientras Tabitha persigue a Bing.</desc><credits><director>Craig Macneill</director><actor>Zachary Quinto</actor><actor>Ashleigh Cummings</actor><actor>Ólafur Ólafsson</actor><actor>Jahkara Smith</actor><actor>Ebon Moss-Bachrach</actor><actor>Virginia Kull</actor><actor>Jonathan Langdon</actor><actor>Ashley Romans</actor><actor>Mattea Conforti</actor><actor>Jason David</actor></credits><date>20200712</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.3.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E04</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/a0745ff3403b4b02bc96677b5eef101d5b34411d.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261014190500 +0000" stop="20261014195300 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">NOS4A2</title><sub-title lang="es">Bruce Wayne McQueen</sub-title><desc lang="es">Vic McQueen regresa a Lakehouse solo para dirigirse directamente hacia una trampa mortal. Charlie Manx cobra a su favor. Aparece el Hombre del Reloj de Arena, un creativo fuerte y poderoso.</desc><credits><director>Hanelle Culpepper</director><actor>Zachary Quinto</actor><actor>Ashleigh Cummings</actor><actor>Ólafur Ólafsson</actor><actor>Jahkara Smith</actor><actor>Ebon Moss-Bachrach</actor><actor>Virginia Kull</actor><actor>Jonathan Langdon</actor><actor>Ashley Romans</actor><actor>Mattea Conforti</actor><actor>Jason David</actor><actor>Paul Schneider</actor></credits><date>20200719</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.4.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E05</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/594649351d5e0c24709787a2dc7bd14b86ca8c96.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261014195300 +0000" stop="20261014204700 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">NOS4A2</title><sub-title lang="es">El reloj de arena</sub-title><desc lang="es">Maggie se pone en peligro al intentar sacar a un creativo oscuro y fuerte del tablero. Vic y Lou trabajan para reparar el cuchillo de Vic. Linda y Chris lidian con el regalo de Vic. Wayne hace amistad con una persona misteriosa.</desc><credits><director>Hanelle Culpepper</director><actor>Zachary Quinto</actor><actor>Ashleigh Cummings</actor><actor>Ólafur Ólafsson</actor><actor>Jahkara Smith</actor><actor>Ebon Moss-Bachrach</actor><actor>Virginia Kull</actor><actor>Jonathan Langdon</actor><actor>Ashley Romans</actor><actor>Mattea Conforti</actor><actor>Jason David</actor><actor>Dalton Harrod</actor><actor>Paul Schneider</actor><actor>Murphy Guyer</actor><actor>Norm Lewis</actor></credits><date>20200726</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.5.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E06</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/20a42124e992ffb082eb1a4d5d461cca581da567.jpg"/></programme>
