<programme start="20261013160000 +0000" stop="20261013180000 +0000" channel="NHL Network"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Ottawa Senators at New Jersey Devils</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Ottawa Senators face the New Jersey Devils in an Eastern Conference game at Prudential Center. In their last three meetings, New Jersey holds a 2-1 advantage over Ottawa, beating them 4-3 in OT in April behind two goals from Nico Hischier.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261013180000 +0000" stop="20261013200000 +0000" channel="NHL Network"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Florida Panthers at Buffalo Sabres</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Buffalo Sabres host the Florida Panthers in an early-season Atlantic Division clash. Matthew Tkachuk leads the Panthers in points and goals, while Owen Power leads the Sabres in points and assists. Jonah Gadjovich is sidelined due to an injury.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
