<programme start="20261014220000 +0000" stop="20261014230000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">How Did They Fix That?</title><sub-title lang="en">US Navy Hovercraft Overhaul</sub-title><desc lang="en">Mike joins the Assault Craft Unit 5, the U.S. Navy&apos;s team for Landing Craft Air Cushions (LCACs); LCACs carry heavy vehicles and troops onto beaches; Mike helps fly &amp; fix an overhauled LCAC during a U.S. Marines beach assault training mission.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25005731_b_v8_ab.jpg"/></programme>
